  "description": "For an orphan, Lee Goyo is a lucky child. She was rescued along with a prosecutor’s son in a kidnapping 14 years ago and became the adopted daughter of ex-prosecutor Lee Uitaek. However, she didn’t have a sweet life, but a life of hellfire. In exchange for being with Lee Uitaek and his son, she became their doll and dog. \n\n“Lee Uitaek told me to seduce you.”\n\n “If I tease you, will you come?”\n\n “What do you think we’ll do all night long?”\n\n “…I guess I was thinking too grandly. In the end, it was just going to be a meaningless night.”\n\n In order to survive, she had to continue proving her worth even if it meant seducing KJ Finance’s president, Kwon Jaeheon, a man she had no relationship with. \n\n “What I want is… A life of freedom. \n\nNo matter how hard she struggled, she couldn’t escape that hell on her own.\n\n “Promise me one thing. Promise that you’ll save me from them.”\n\n I would even eat a poisoned apple.\n\n “I told you that I’d give it to you even if it killed me. Don’t you trust me?”\n\n At that moment, that crazy and dangerous man seemed like a savior leading her to paradise in Goyo’s eyes.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \nR19: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5636000050), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/savage_paradise), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/beasts_paradise), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12061825), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000067562), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=250062), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/67474473), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/webtoon/episode/toon/9064)      \nR15: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5636000077), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/beasts_paradise_15), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12736236), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000077573), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260100), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70054340) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR19: [French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/a-beasts-paradise/list?title_no=9330), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/209727)   \nR15: [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/209726)",
